<title>USA: Simplot cuts ASARCO stake to 4.34 pct.</title>
<headline>Simplot cuts ASARCO stake to 4.34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Idaho investor John Simplot said Monday he cut his stake in ASARCO Inc to 1,855,300 common shares or 4.34 percent from 5.85 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Simplot said his latest transactions include the sale of 544,00 common shares from July 9 to October 9 at prices ranging from $24.837 to $27.276 per share.</p>
<p>Simplot gave no reason for the sales of the stock, the filing said.</p>
</text>
